      "notes": "One attempt consumes one Unsired at the Font of Consumption. Rewards roll on offering (2 September 2026 update). Weights are 62 for any bludgeon piece, 26 dagger, 12 whip, 13 jar, 10 head, 5 pet. Owning the pet removes its five slots (128 to 123); leave pet ownership at zero if reclaimable from Probita. Bludgeon pieces are uniform among missing pieces, with protection restarting after each complete set. Enter pieces held toward the current bludgeon; completed sets are treated as assembled. Results retain component drops, not assembled bludgeons, so GP excludes their assembled value. Source: Unsired, Rewards, wiki revision 15328493."
